# Services

## Canonical Examples

- **Service structure**: See `src/services/control-plane/app.service/app.service.ts`
- **controlPlaneService usage**: See `src/services/control-plane/control-plane.service/control-plane.service.ts`
- **Service testing**: See `src/services/control-plane/audit.service/audit.service.test.ts`

## Key Patterns

- Export service as object: `export const userService = { getAll, getById };`
- Keep functions private, expose only through the object
- Use `controlPlaneService` for API calls (handles auth, base URL)
- Always specify explicit return types
